      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "As the absolute concentrations of TrkA, Ras, Raf, Mek and Erk are unknown, this system is structurally non-",
      "bbox": [
        48.189056396484375,
        316.3199768066406,
        547.14599609375,
        325.166748046875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "identiﬁable. To circumvent this we reformulate the system in terms of x1 = k3[TrkA:NGF], x2 = k6[Ras:GTP],",
      "bbox": [
        48.189056396484375,
        328.27496337890625,
        547.0947265625,
        338.6167297363281
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
