      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The solution of this ODE model merely depends on the parameters k1, k2, k4, k5, k7, k9 and k11, and the parameter",
      "bbox": [
        48.188995361328125,
        509.3429260253906,
        547.0971069335938,
        519.6846923828125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "products k3[TrkA]0, sK3, k6[Ras]0, k8[Raf]0, k10[Mek]0 and s[Erk]0. Thus, we obtain the reduced vector of kinetic",
