        564.932861328125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "As initial condition we use the steady state of this system for [NGF]0 = 0, which is equivalent to the initial condition",
      "bbox": [
        48.18902587890625,
        581.0739135742188,
        547.1288452148438,
        591.4157104492188
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "for pathway model B.",
      "bbox": [
        48.18902587890625,
        593.0289306640625,
        142.73411560058594,
        601.875732421875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "3.3.3",
      "bbox": [
        48.18902587890625,
        622.909912109375,
        71.73065185546875,
        631.7567138671875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Parameter estimation",
      "bbox": [
        83.1876449584961,
        622.909912109375,
        191.84974670410156,
        631.7567138671875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "For the parameter estimation and model selection we constrained the kinetic parameter ki to the interval [10−3, 103].",
      "bbox": [
        48.18902587890625,
        643.3526000976562,
        547.0911865234375,
        655.625732421875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The range of the kinetic parameters is smaller than for pathway model A but still six order of magnitude wide. The",
      "bbox": [
        48.188995361328125,
        657.2398681640625,
        547.135986328125,
        666.086669921875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "range had to be reduced as we encountered numerical integration problems for the ODE solvers. The subpopulation",
      "bbox": [
        48.188995361328125,
        669.1948852539062,
        547.1458740234375,
        678.0416870117188
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "sizes wi have been constrained to [0, 1].",
      "bbox": [
        48.188995361328125,
        681.14990234375,
        227.23851013183594,
        691.49169921875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Standard deviations of normal distributions and shape parameters of",
      "bbox": [
        235.6170654296875,
        681.14990234375,
        547.1575927734375,
        689.9967041015625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "log-normal distributions were constrained to [10−1, 102] and [10−1, 101], respectively.",
      "bbox": [
        48.188995361328125,
        691.173583984375,
        416.5049743652344,
        701.9517211914062
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Pathway model C possesses a negative feedback loop and can oscillate. It turned out that several runs of the local",
      "bbox": [
        48.188995361328125,
        709.0458984375,
        547.1159057617188,
        717.8927001953125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "optimiser converged to parameters for which the system exhibits very fast oscillations. As very fast oscillations have",
      "bbox": [
        48.188995361328125,
        721.0009155273438,
        547.10595703125,
        729.8477172851562
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "not been observed experimentally, we ﬁlter the parameter for which the system oscillates heavily. More precisely,",
      "bbox": [
        48.188995361328125,
        732.9559326171875,
        547.1061401367188,
        741.802734375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "we excluded parameters for which the simulated trajectory for 1 ng/ml NGF exhibit more than ﬁve peaks in the",
      "bbox": [
        48.188995361328125,
        744.910888671875,
        547.1361083984375,
        753.7576904296875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "time interval from 0 to 60 min.",
      "bbox": [
        48.188995361328125,
        756.8659057617188,
        183.59068298339844,
        765.7127075195312
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
